    {
      "id": 149288,
      "name": "jffdougan",
      "username": "jffdougan",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jffdougan/{size}/1882_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-10-08T01:49:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Donner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/48/1903_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Donner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Is there anything we can do to help?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I wish there was. I know my cousins will be taking this hard, Erin (the youngest) especially. It looks to me like I'm going to be grounded Stateside due to having an expired passport &amp; being unable to renew it in sufficient time. My current state of residence doesn't offer the Enhanced Driver's License option, and the processing time for the PASS document (mini-passport card) can't turn around in time for me to make the trip.</p>\n<p>To be slightly fair to my father, his younger sisters tell me that their sister was difficult and his feelings have some justification. But at the same time, he's been an ass to that family as long as I can remember.</p>",
